1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:04,580
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Parents have different ways of punishing their kids.

2
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,700
Some parents ground their kids.

3
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:11,360
Grounding means that kids are not allowed to

4
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:12,620
do fun things.

5
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:17,740
This includes watching TV, going out with friends,

6
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:20,220
and playing video games.

7
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:24,120
Some parents give their kids long speeches.

8
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:27,080
They would yell at them or tell them

9
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:28,080
what they did wrong.

10
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:32,460
Some parents give their kids the silent treatment.

11
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:36,520
The silent treatment is when the parents don't

12
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:37,540
talk to the kids.

13
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:41,860
Some parents make their kids do more chores.

14
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:46,140
Some parents don't even punish their kids.

15
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:48,460
They are very lenient.
